#. news title
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid "Release GCompris 1.0"
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"Hi,<br />\\nTo celebrate the 20 years of GCompris, we are pleased to "
"announce the release of GCompris version 1.0."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"This new version contains a new major feature: the addition of the Activity "
"Settings menu with Dataset selection for more than 50 activities, allowing "
"to choose more specifically what can be learned on the activities."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid "We also added 4 new activities:"
msgstr ""

#. list item
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"The long awaited Analog Electricity activity which allows us to draw "
"circuits and run their simulation."
msgstr ""

#. list item
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"Learn digits and two subactivities to learn additions and subtractions. The "
"aim is to teach these concepts to younger children, with easy computations."
msgstr ""

#. list item
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"Baby keyboard where, when a character is typed on the keyboard, we display "
"it on the screen and play the corresponding voice if it exists."
msgstr ""

#. list item
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"Gravity, which replaces the old Intro Gravity, explains better the concept "
"and is more realistic."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"You can find packages of this new version for GNU/Linux, Windows, MacOS and "
"Raspberry Pi on the <a href=\\\"https://gcompris.net/downloads{{ suffix }}."
"html\\\">download page</a>. This update will also be available soon in the "
"Android Play store, the F-Droid repository and the Windows store. Note that "
"the MacOS package is not notarized."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"You can check on this page the voices status in your language: <a href=\\"
"\"https://gcompris.net/voicestats/\\\">https://gcompris.net/voicestats/</a>. "
"You can help us by providing a nice recording of your voice for all the "
"missing entries in your native language."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"On the translation side, we have 22 languages fully supported: Basque, "
"Breton, British English, Catalan, Catalan (Valencian), Chinese Traditional, "
"Dutch, French, Greek, Hebrew, Hungarian, Indonesian, Italian, Malayalam, "
"Polish, Portuguese, Romanian, Slovenian, Spanish, Swedish, Turkish, "
"Ukrainian."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"We also have 4 languages partially supported: Belarusian (85%), Brazilian "
"Portuguese (92%), German (89%), Lithuanian (84%)."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"As said in the previous news, we decided to only ship translations that are "
"at least 80% completed to let the children have a better experience and not "
"half translated software. Unfortunately, we had to drop the translation for: "
"Estonian, Finnish, Irish Gaelic, Scottish Gaelic, Galician, Hindi, "
"Macedonian, Norwegian Nynorsk, Russian, Slovak and Chinese Simplified."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"If your language is in the partially supported list, or is no more or not "
"yet supported at all, and you want to help, please contact us "
"(support@gcompris.net) and we will give you instructions to get started "
"translating."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid ""
"Another way to help is to write some posts in your community about GCompris, "
"and don't hesitate to give us some feedback."
msgstr ""

#. paragraph
msgctxt "20201119.html"
msgid "Thank you all, <br/>\\nTimothée & Johnny"
msgstr ""

